</script>
<template><div class="pc-overview"><section class="pc-card pc-today"><div class="pc-card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">今天的一步</p><h2>今日双目标</h2></div><button @click="$emit('goals')">设置目标</button></div><div class="pc-goals"><GoalRing label="作答目标" :value="dashboard.today.answered" :target="profile.daily_questions" unit="次"/><GoalRing label="记录时长" :value="dashboard.today.duration_ms/60000" :target="profile.daily_minutes" unit="分钟"/></div><details class="pc-table-details"><summary>查看今日目标数据表</summary><div class="pc-table-scroll"><table><caption>今日实际完成量与设置目标</caption><thead><tr><th>目标</th><th>实际</th><th>目标值</th><th>进度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>作答次数</td><td>{{ dashboard.today.answered }}</td><td>{{ profile.daily_questions }}</td><td>{{ Math.round(Math.min(100,dashboard.today.answered/profile.daily_questions*100)) }}%</td></tr><tr><td>记录分钟</td><td>{{ (dashboard.today.duration_ms/60000).toFixed(1) }}</td><td>{{ profile.daily_minutes }}</td><td>{{ Math.round(Math.min(100,dashboard.today.duration_ms/60000/profile.daily_minutes*100)) }}%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="pc-today-footer"><p>已连续练习 <strong>{{ dashboard.streak.current }}</strong> 天 · 最长 {{ dashboard.streak.longest }} 天<span v-if="!dashboard.streak.practiced_today"> · 今天继续，走稳下一步</span></p><RouterLink class="button primary" to="/questions">开始今日练习</RouterLink></div></section><div class="pc-counts"><article class="pc-card"><span>期间作答次数</span><strong>{{ dashboard.period.answered.toLocaleString() }}</strong><small>较上期 {{ dashboard.period.answered-dashboard.previous.answered>=0?'+':'' }}{{ dashboard.period.answered-dashboard.previous.answered }} 次</small></article><article class="pc-card"><span>期间正确率</span><strong>{{ accuracy(dashboard.period.accuracy) }}</strong><small>答对 {{ dashboard.period.correct }} 次 / 作答 {{ dashboard.period.answered }} 次</small></article><article class="pc-card"><span>期间记录时长</span><strong>{{ (dashboard.period.duration_ms/60000).toFixed(1) }}<em> 分钟</em></strong><small>{{ d